          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabeikhabi abaleeranga omulembe; shichila balalangungwa mbu abaana baNyasaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.5.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 5:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.5.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.5.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabeikhabi abasandilibwa obulunjishi; shichila obwami obwomwikulu nobwabwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.5.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 5:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.5.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.5.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 5:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muli abeikhabi inywe olwa bamunyeka, nibamusandia, nibamuchiikha amakhuwa amabii amanji, khulwanje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.5.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.5.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwikhoye, nimusangaala muno; shichila omukabo kwenywe nomunji mwikulu; okhuba niIwo olwa basandia abalakusi abamuranjilila.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.5.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Omuunyu nende obulafu",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 5:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.5.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.5.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninywe omuunyu kweshialo; ne omuunyu nikuba nikutsinziibe, kulalungwa nende shiina? Shikukaasila eshindu khandi ta, habula okhusukunwa elwanyi nikuseenwa namakulu kabandu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.5.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 5:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.5.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.5.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 5:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ninywe obulafu bweshialo. Litaala elili khushikulu sl ilinyala okhubisikha ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.5.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.5.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 5:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata abandu shibahambinjia itaha nibachifuunikha hasi mushimwelo ta, habula bachira khushichibi shiayo; niyibakhosilia bosi abali munzu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.5.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.5.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kho obulafu bweenywe nabwo bwashenje burio imbeli wabandu, mbu balole ebikhole bieenywe ebilayi nibamuheelesia Seenywe ouli mwikulu oluyali.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.5.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka Yesu yeechesia khukAmalako",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 5:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.5.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.5.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 5:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Murakaala mbu ndeetsa okhutibial amalako kata abanabii tawe; shindayeetsa okhutibia tawe, habula okhuusia. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.5.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.5.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 5:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Okhuba emuboolela toto mbu okhuula olwa likulu nende eshibala biliba nibihweele, kata inyukuta ndala kata akharoonyelesi khalala shikhalihwaho mumalako ta, okhuula olwa kosi kaliba nikoosibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.5.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.5.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 5:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khulwako, omundu yesi outendeyia lilako kata elala elishila obutuutu mukano, niyeechesia abandu ario, omwenoyo alilangwa mbu omutuutu muno mubwami obwomwikulu; nebutswa omundu yesi oukakhola niyeechesia ario, omwenoyo alilangwa mbu omukhongo mubwami obwomwikulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.5.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.5.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "MAT 5:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shichila emusunjila mbu obulunjishi bweenywe nibuba niburashila obwabahandiichi nende abaFarisayo ta, shimuliinjila mubwami obwomwikulu nahatuutu tawe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "MAT.5.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "MAT.5.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Aka Yesu yeechesia khukoburima",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
