          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mbu mana mube abaana baSeenywe ouli mwikulu; shichila abafwindilinjia eliubalie ababii nende abalayi, nabakwisilia ifula abalunjishi nende abarali abalunjishi ta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
